  type: 4
  trashHints:
  - "I think someone tried to build a fireplace on the beach \u2013 a bad idea. Everything
    is so dry here, but I am sure there must be some branches left over. I think
    you could add some of them to make the item! "
  - 'I saw that sometimes stuff gets washed up on the beach after a tide. Maybe toss
    some of that into the mix too? Couldn''t hurt. '
  - "storms usually bring marine wrack in... I saw some big one\u2019s last week
    buried in the sand. If you find some, you could add them to the mix? "
  - 'I like to collect these sometimes- some of them look so cool! I heard you can
    even use them for sculptures or decorative furniture. Usually, you can find them
    near the beach. I think you may need to add something like these as well. '
  materialName: Wood
